"20. An ARAMCO project requires 100% RT of all P91 pressure pipe girth welds. RT is completed and accepted on Weld W-22. Two days later, the pipe is post-weld heat treated (PWHT). After PWHT, the inspector requests a further RT. The contractor says RT was already completed and accepted — no repeat is needed. What is correct?",
